  "notes": "One fixture per run, as in a real case. A DOCX fixture (L1-DOC_selftest.docx, author L1 SELFTEST, revision 3) is provided for a separate manual run; hashes in selftest/FIXTURE_HASHES.json.",
  "assertions": [
    {
